### Feature Users — CREATE / UPDATE / DELETE (modalidad JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/session/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### CREATE — recurso `POST /api/users`. El `password` se hashea (bcrypt, 12 rondas).
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nuevo.usuario",
  "email": "nuevo.usuario@saludconecta.local",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "avatar": null
}

@id = {{createUser.response.body.$.user.id}}

### 409 — username/email ya en uso
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "email": "otro@saludconecta.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### UPDATE PUT — reemplazo completo. No cambia `password` ni `status`.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nuevo.usuario",
  "email": "nuevo.usuario@saludconecta.local",
  "avatar": "https://example.com/avatar.png"
}

### UPDATE PATCH — parcial
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "avatar": null
}

### CAMBIO DE CONTRASEÑA — exige la contraseña actual
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{id}}/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "Password123!",
  "new_password": "Password456!"
}

### 400 — contraseña actual incorrecta
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{id}}/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "no-es-la-actual",
  "new_password": "Password789!"
}

### DELETE lógico — el usuario queda inactivo: sus tokens dejan de valer (401)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### DELETE físico
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
